  {
   "id": "4.8",
   "titulo": "Reacciones adversas",
   "html": "<div>\r\n    <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">Las reacciones adversas, presentadas en la siguiente tabla, se clasifican según la Clasificación de Órganos del Sistema y la frecuencia, utilizando los siguientes términos: muy frecuentes (≥ 1/10), frecuentes (≥ 1/100 a < 1/10), poco frecuentes (> 1/1.000 a < 1/100), raras (> 1/10.000 a < 1/1.000), muy raras (<1/10.000), frecuencia no conocida (no se pueden estimar a partir de los datos disponibles).</span></p>\r\n\r\n    <p style=\"margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 28.35pt; text-align:justify; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n    <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; margin-left:0pt\">\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:2.25pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:0.75pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:2.25pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:71.3pt\">\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\">Clasificación de órganos sistema</span></strong></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n\r\n        <td colspan=\"5\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:0.75pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:2.25pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:2.25pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:379.15pt\">\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt;\">Reacciones adversas, incluyendo signos de tolerancia local</span></strong></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:0.75pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:0.75pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:67.75pt\">\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">Muy frecuente</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">s</span></p>\r\n\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">(≥1/10)</span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n\r\n        <td style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:0.75pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:0.75pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:68.85pt\">\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">Frecuentes</span></p>\r\n\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">(≥ 1/100 a</span></p>\r\n\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">< 1/10)</span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n\r\n        <td style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:0.75pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:0.75pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:88.4pt\">\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">Poco frecuentes</span></p>\r\n\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">(≥ 1/1.000 a</span></p>\r\n\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">< 1/100)</span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n\r\n        <td style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:0.75pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:0.75pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:71.4pt\">\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">Raras</span></p>\r\n\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">(≥ 1/10,000 a < 1/1.000)</span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n\r\n        <td style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:0.75pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:2.25pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:82.75pt\">\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">Desconocidas (no pueden estimarse a partir de los datos disponibles)</span></p>\r\n\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"> </span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:2.25pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:0.75pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:71.3pt\">\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\">Trastornos de la piel y de los tejidos subcutáneos</span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n\r\n        <td style=\"border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-left-color:#000000; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:0.75pt; border-right-color:#000000; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:0.75pt; border-top-color:#000000; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-left:5.4pt; padding-right:5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:67.75pt\">\r\n          <p style=\"margin:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:115%; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:11pt\"> </span></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n\r\n        <td style=\"border-bot